{
    "title": "Booba Kitchen: Kids Cooking!",
    "description": "Booba welcomes you to kids cooking food games!\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udf73 Cook cakes, pizza and burgers and become a real chef in the kitchen! Food making games liked by all girls and boys! \ud83c\udf54\ud83c\udf5f\ud83c\udf55\r\n\r\nGood evening! Welcome!\r\nHere's Booba's Kitchen, your favorite late-night show! \ud83c\udf99\ufe0f\r\nAnd I, its permanent host \u2014 who knows not only how to cook delicious food, but also do it with great passion and energy \u2014 am talking Booba the Chef! Big round of applause!\r\n\r\nToday, I'm ready to announce a casting call for my incredibly entertaining and fun food making games!\r\n\r\nOur contestants are people from all over the world that love cooking burgers, pizza, cakes and are eager to showcase their skills in cooking for kids. \ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f\r\n\r\nNow is your chance to prove yourself in food games for kids! Who knows, maybe you'll become the next cooking star!\r\n\r\nBut don't think it's going to be easy! In kids cooking games, I'm looking for chefs who aren't afraid to experiment and create new, authentic meals.\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73\r\n\r\nIn our food games for kids, I prepared the following challenges for participants:\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd51 CONVEYOR BELT\r\nVegetables and fruit are on their way to the conveyor belt. You have to use your hand and cut them in half. However, be careful in these food making games, because there's also trash on this conveyor belt that you're not supposed to touch! Ki-i-i-ya!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf53 FRUIT NINJA\r\nSlice all the food that flies toward you but avoid muffin bombs so you don't lose points! Be fast and careful in games for 5-year-old!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\uddca DEFROSTING\r\nSmash ice cubes to defrost the products inside them. And Booba will be there to help you do just that! Brrrrr! Food making games are so funny!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd55 GRATER\r\nGrate the food falling from the top with an electric grater. Stay focused, it's the only way to get the job done in cooking for kids!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd6c GREENS HARVESTING\r\nKeep tapping the sprouts to collect leaves to garnish your dishes with. Playing kids cooking games in which it is better not to be distracted, because the worm is ready to ruin everything! Ouch!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf73 COOKING IN THE KITCHEN\r\nAll the ingredients are ready! Let's start cooking for kids!\r\nBurgers, pizza or cakes? In these games for 5-year-old, you can choose what works for your recipe. And I, Chef talking Booba, as a true master of my craft, will be happy to show you how to cook certain dishes properly and share my most valuable secrets! A round of applause!\r\nKids food games in which you have to create something truly original and delicious!\r\n\r\nWell, I see you're almost done... All what's left is to beautifully serve the dish in kids cooking games! \r\n\r\nRemember, only the most talented chefs will pass all the tests and win.\r\nAt the end of each episode, I will announce the winner and reward them with awesome prizes! \ud83c\udfc6\r\nYou will get an unforgettable experience and valuable knowledge in food games for kids, that will win the hearts of viewers around the world.\r\n\r\nYour subscription will automatically renew at the end of the subscription period. The free trial will automatically convert to a paid subscription at the end of the trial period unless you turn off the auto-renew at least 24 hours before the end of the period.\r\nYour account will be charged for the applicable subscription fee within 24 hours of the end of the previous subscription period or trial period. You may turn off auto-renewal at any time from your Google account settings.\r\nThe current version of Terms of Use is available here: https://devgamekids.com/terms-of-use.html\r\n\r\nYour opinion is important to us!\r\n\u2709\ufe0f Contact us: support@devgameou.com\r\n\ud83d\udd14 Stay tuned: https://www.facebook.com/DEVGAME.Kids \r\n\ud83d\udcbb Our website: https://devgameou.com\r\n\r\nStay tuned, dear viewers, enjoy games for 5-year-old and let's plunge into the world of kids cooking together in food making games! Also, don't forget to like and subscribe to my cooking blog - Booba Kitchen!\r\nYours truly is your favorite chef, talking Booba! A big round of applause! \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73",
    "descriptionHTML": "Booba welcomes you to kids cooking food games!\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udf73 Cook cakes, pizza and burgers and become a real chef in the kitchen! Food making games liked by all girls and boys! \ud83c\udf54\ud83c\udf5f\ud83c\udf55<br><br>Good evening! Welcome!<br>Here&#39;s Booba&#39;s Kitchen, your favorite late-night show! \ud83c\udf99\ufe0f<br>And I, its permanent host \u2014 who knows not only how to cook delicious food, but also do it with great passion and energy \u2014 am talking Booba the Chef! Big round of applause!<br><br>Today, I&#39;m ready to announce a casting call for my incredibly entertaining and fun food making games!<br><br>Our contestants are people from all over the world that love cooking burgers, pizza, cakes and are eager to showcase their skills in cooking for kids. \ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f<br><br>Now is your chance to prove yourself in food games for kids! Who knows, maybe you&#39;ll become the next cooking star!<br><br>But don&#39;t think it&#39;s going to be easy! In kids cooking games, I&#39;m looking for chefs who aren&#39;t afraid to experiment and create new, authentic meals.\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73<br><br>In our food games for kids, I prepared the following challenges for participants:<br><br>\ud83e\udd51 CONVEYOR BELT<br>Vegetables and fruit are on their way to the conveyor belt. You have to use your hand and cut them in half. However, be careful in these food making games, because there&#39;s also trash on this conveyor belt that you&#39;re not supposed to touch! Ki-i-i-ya!<br><br>\ud83c\udf53 FRUIT NINJA<br>Slice all the food that flies toward you but avoid muffin bombs so you don&#39;t lose points! Be fast and careful in games for 5-year-old!<br><br>\ud83e\uddca DEFROSTING<br>Smash ice cubes to defrost the products inside them. And Booba will be there to help you do just that! Brrrrr! Food making games are so funny!<br><br>\ud83e\udd55 GRATER<br>Grate the food falling from the top with an electric grater. Stay focused, it&#39;s the only way to get the job done in cooking for kids!<br><br>\ud83e\udd6c GREENS HARVESTING<br>Keep tapping the sprouts to collect leaves to garnish your dishes with. Playing kids cooking games in which it is better not to be distracted, because the worm is ready to ruin everything! Ouch!<br><br>\ud83c\udf73 COOKING IN THE KITCHEN<br>All the ingredients are ready! Let&#39;s start cooking for kids!<br>Burgers, pizza or cakes? In these games for 5-year-old, you can choose what works for your recipe. And I, Chef talking Booba, as a true master of my craft, will be happy to show you how to cook certain dishes properly and share my most valuable secrets! A round of applause!<br>Kids food games in which you have to create something truly original and delicious!<br><br>Well, I see you&#39;re almost done... All what&#39;s left is to beautifully serve the dish in kids cooking games! <br><br>Remember, only the most talented chefs will pass all the tests and win.<br>At the end of each episode, I will announce the winner and reward them with awesome prizes! \ud83c\udfc6<br>You will get an unforgettable experience and valuable knowledge in food games for kids, that will win the hearts of viewers around the world.<br><br>Your subscription will automatically renew at the end of the subscription period. The free trial will automatically convert to a paid subscription at the end of the trial period unless you turn off the auto-renew at least 24 hours before the end of the period.<br>Your account will be charged for the applicable subscription fee within 24 hours of the end of the previous subscription period or trial period. You may turn off auto-renewal at any time from your Google account settings.<br>The current version of Terms of Use is available here: https://devgamekids.com/terms-of-use.html<br><br>Your opinion is important to us!<br>\u2709\ufe0f Contact us: support@devgameou.com<br>\ud83d\udd14 Stay tuned: https://www.facebook.com/DEVGAME.Kids <br>\ud83d\udcbb Our website: https://devgameou.com<br><br>Stay tuned, dear viewers, enjoy games for 5-year-old and let&#39;s plunge into the world of kids cooking together in food making games! Also, don&#39;t forget to like and subscribe to my cooking blog - Booba Kitchen!<br>Yours truly is your favorite chef, talking Booba! A big round of applause! \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73",
